<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Compaq raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial said analyst Mark Specker upgraded Compaq Computer Corp to short-term buy from hold, and kept the long-term rating at buy.</p>
<p>-- earnings estimates were unchanged at $4.67 for fiscal 1996, and $5.69 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 2-7/8 to 75-1/8.</p>
</text>
